This is a fork of github.com/vectorcore-mobile/vectorcore-hss, maintained by
itskimffs. It last merged upstream at commit 20698b6.

Modifications in this fork (itskimffs, 2026-11); each modified file carries a notice:
- Zh: the dictionary declares the Multimedia-Auth request and answer rules and
  the SIP AVPs, so the HSS can read a BSF's MAR; the MAR resynchronises the
  SQN from RAND || AUTS, and the MAA carries the GUSS (GBA-UserSecSettings,
  TS 29.109 Annex A) with the IMS subscriber's public identities
  (internal/diameter/zh)
- Sh: repository data (transparent data) per IMS Public User Identity and
  Service-Indication, with PUR and UDR (TS 29.328, TS 29.329), the AS
  permission list hss.ShRepositoryDataAS and the table sh_repository_data
  (internal/diameter/sh, internal/repository, internal/models, internal/config,
  internal/diameter/server.go, config/hss.yaml)
- API and web UI: view, change, add and delete Sh repository data, kept with
  the IMS subscriber on delete, backup and restore (internal/api, web/src)

The fork's earlier Rx change (no PCC rule for AF signalling) is now in
upstream itself, as commit c13d1ae.
